sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Customer (via gateway)
    participant OC as OrderController
    participant S as CheckoutSaga
    participant R as OrderRepository
    participant CA as cart-service
    participant I as inventory-service
    participant P as payment-service
    C->>OC: POST /orders (Idempotency-Key, JWT)
    OC->>S: place(customer, email, key, token)
    S->>R: findByIdempotencyKey
    R-->>S: none
    S->>CA: checkout snapshot
    CA-->>S: priced lines
    S->>R: insert order PENDING + key + OrderPlaced (one transaction)
    S->>I: reserve
    I-->>S: Reserved
    S->>R: step STOCK_RESERVED
    S->>P: authorize (2 s)
    P-->>S: Approved
    S->>R: step PAYMENT_AUTHORIZED
    S->>I: commit
    S->>R: step STOCK_COMMITTED
    S->>P: capture
    S->>R: CONFIRMED + OrderConfirmed (one transaction)
    S-->>OC: CONFIRMED
    OC-->>C: 201 Created
